    {
      "id": "claim_2e87572d22ee46f5be11d2780ae620a1",
      "statement": "The recommended shared-cache Redis deployment is redis:7.4 run with --appendonly yes and a persisted data volume so the cache survives restarts; Redis has no authentication by default, so when it is reachable beyond a trusted network a password and/or TLS should be enabled and the credentials embedded in REDIS_URL (rediss://user:pass@host:6380).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L245-L273",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3092f6cc30ea456791c3c85193fcaba2d2f1903a07adb1b6145472e8c5cc3b5f:"
        }
