    {
      "id": "claim_494da28d8a484a65865ee7fd52d139e1",
      "statement": "The REST-Redis backend is served by org.fuchss:rest-redis (version 0.1.5 in this library's dependency set), published as the ghcr.io/dfuchss/rest-redis Docker image and configured via server_config.json with the keys redis_host, redis_port, and http_port. The intended topology is client → reverse proxy (TLS + Basic auth) → REST-Redis server → Redis, because the server itself has no built-in authentication or TLS; on a trusted network the client may point REST_REDIS_URI at the server directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L283-L342",
