      "statement": "verify.yml runs the shared ardoco Maven workflow (ardoco/actions/.github/workflows/maven.yml@main) with deploy: false and submodules checked out, triggered by pushes to main (ignoring v* tags), pull requests of types opened/synchronize/reopened, and manual dispatch; its paths-ignore for docs/** and openwiki/** keeps wiki- or doc-only changes from triggering builds.",
